            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-[#4B5565]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#3478F6] font-bold">&check;</span>
                <span>Verified against peer-reviewed literature</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#3478F6] font-bold">&check;</span>
